# bible.db WAS a pure build artifact, regenerable from assets/. It no longer is:
# it now carries the English translation, which cannot be rebuilt from the
# Amharic source. It is tracked deliberately, and committed at milestones rather
# than on every change so the history doesn't fill with 15 MB blobs.
